# 🎮 Wiki Toram Online - Implementation Plan

## Overview
เว็บไซต์ Wiki สำหรับเกม Toram Online เวอร์ชันภาษาไทย ออกแบบมาเพื่อให้ผู้เล่นชาวไทยเข้าถึงข้อมูลเกมได้ง่ายและสวยงาม

## Tech Stack
| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| Frontend | React 19 + Vite |
| Styling | TailwindCSS v4 |
| Routing | React Router v7 |
| State | React Context + useReducer |
| Data | JSON files (Phase 1) → PostgreSQL (Phase 4) |
| Deployment | Vercel / VPS + Nginx |

## Phase 1: Foundation (Current)
- [x] สร้างโปรเจกต์ React + Vite + TailwindCSS
- [x] ออกแบบ Database Schema
- [x] สร้าง UI Components พื้นฐาน
- [x] หน้า Landing Page
- [x] หน้ารายการ Items / Monsters
- [x] หน้ารายละเอียดข้อมูล

## Phase 2: Data & Content
- [ ] สร้างระบบ Search & Filter
- [ ] ระบบ Localization (EN/TH)
- [ ] Data Scraping Scripts (Python)
- [ ] เพิ่มข้อมูลเกมจริง

## Phase 3: Advanced Features
- [ ] Stat Calculator
- [ ] Skill Simulator
- [ ] Build Planner
- [ ] User Accounts & Bookmarks

## Phase 4: Production
- [ ] Backend API (Node.js/Express)
- [ ] PostgreSQL Database
- [ ] Authentication
- [ ] Deployment & CDN

---

## Database Schema

### Core Tables

```mermaid
erDiagram
    ITEMS ||--o{ DROP_LIST : "dropped as"
    MONSTERS ||--o{ DROP_LIST : "drops"
    MONSTERS ||--o{ MONSTER_LOCATIONS : "found at"
    MAPS ||--o{ MONSTER_LOCATIONS : "contains"
    ITEMS ||--o{ ITEM_STATS : "has"
    SKILLS ||--o{ SKILL_EFFECTS : "has"
    SKILL_TREES ||--o{ SKILLS : "contains"

    ITEMS {
        int id PK
        string name_en
        string name_th
        string type "weapon|armor|additional|special|crystal|material|consumable"
        string sub_type "sword|bow|staff|etc"
        int level_req
        int sell_price
        string image_url
        boolean is_tradeable
        string obtain_method
        timestamp created_at
        timestamp updated_at
    }

    ITEM_STATS {
        int id PK
        int item_id FK
        string stat_name "ATK|MATK|DEF|MDEF|HP|MP|etc"
        float base_value
        float max_value
        string stat_type "flat|percent"
    }

    MONSTERS {
        int id PK
        string name_en
        string name_th
        string type "normal|mini_boss|boss|event_boss"
        int level
        int hp
        string element "neutral|fire|water|wind|earth|light|dark"
        int exp_reward
        string image_url
        text note_th
        timestamp created_at
        timestamp updated_at
    }

    MAPS {
        int id PK
        string name_en
        string name_th
        string region
        int level_range_min
        int level_range_max
        string image_url
    }

    MONSTER_LOCATIONS {
        int id PK
        int monster_id FK
        int map_id FK
        string spawn_point
    }

    DROP_LIST {
        int id PK
        int monster_id FK
        int item_id FK
        float drop_rate
        boolean is_breakable "dye/break drop"
        string condition "normal|break|rare"
    }

    SKILLS {
        int id PK
        int skill_tree_id FK
        string name_en
        string name_th
        string type "active|passive|support"
        int max_level
        int mp_cost
        text description_en
        text description_th
        string image_url
    }

    SKILL_TREES {
        int id PK
        string name_en
        string name_th
        string category "blade|shot|magic|martial|dual|halberd|mononofu|barehand|ninja|smith|alchemy|tamer|survival|support"
    }

    SKILL_EFFECTS {
        int id PK
        int skill_id FK
        int skill_level
        float damage_multiplier
        float mp_cost
        int cast_time_ms
        int cooldown_ms
        text effect_description
    }
```

### Item Types Reference
| Type | Sub Types |
|------|-----------|
| weapon | sword, bow, bowgun, staff, magic_device, halberd, katana, knuckle, dual_sword, barehand |
| armor | body_armor, additional_gear, special_gear |
| crystal | weapon_crystal, armor_crystal, special_crystal, enhancer_crystal |
| material | mob_drop, quest_item, processing_material |
| consumable | hp_potion, mp_potion, buff_item, food |

### Monster Element Chart
| Element | Strong Against | Weak Against |
|---------|---------------|-------------|
| 🔥 Fire | Wind, Earth | Water |
| 💧 Water | Fire | Wind |
| 🌪️ Wind | Water | Earth |
| 🌍 Earth | Wind | Fire |
| ✨ Light | Dark | Dark |
| 🌑 Dark | Light | Light |
| ⚪ Neutral | - | - |
